    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/990c3e5fd2af864d949339594b9148f7.poster.avif?t=1755557234\" width=672 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/990c3e5fd2af864d949339594b9148f7.webm?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/990c3e5fd2af864d949339594b9148f7.mp4?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig Dig Burrito is about a burrito inside a burrito digging through all the delicious ingredients inside<strong>\ud83c\udf2f.\u00a0</strong>But you must be careful some ingredients can kill you! You will encounter many different enemies that try to kill you. You'll also choose between many different types of burritos that have drastically different gameplay. Also every burrito is unique and has many different types ingredients, some good some bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/49bc601735091ac72eb589ab63ff2ab3.webp?t=1755557234\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/847ee7654f9b7d84717fbbc01a15996f.poster.avif?t=1755557234\" width=674 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/847ee7654f9b7d84717fbbc01a15996f.webm?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ random burrito events that you can play through. Every three burritos you get to choose between leaving with what you have already gained, or go to the next burrito and play at a slightly higher difficulty level. You can also do one of the many different randomly chosen burrito\u00a0events and possibly gain significantly more points, but at a HIGHER RISK!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/e996982ef9356cee244a468e89b83e8a.webp?t=1755557234\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/fd95a0c0b6f0ca9c496659a427af37c3.poster.avif?t=1755557234\" width=672 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/fd95a0c0b6f0ca9c496659a427af37c3.webm?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/fd95a0c0b6f0ca9c496659a427af37c3.mp4?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There a 7+ upgrades that dramatically change the game! Bigger explosions\ud83d\udca5, Double your points when digging, More health\u2764\ufe0f, More dig's, Start deeper in the level to get a head start, And more burritos<strong>\ud83c\udf2f.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/85279172306407048ed75c2a0a291c70.webp?t=1755557234\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/3fe9c710ffdcf54d790d312ac25f0f54.poster.avif?t=1755557234\" width=674 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/3fe9c710ffdcf54d790d312ac25f0f54.webm?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bugs and other types of enemies to avoid death. If you touch an enemy you instantly die and lose all your progress! So make sure you take a safe path to avoid death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/2d9f04e6d8a4f4244972a3a2b1638c4c.webp?t=1755557234\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/903a96a79be1c43fa57fac5b7a590191.poster.avif?t=1755557234\" width=674 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/903a96a79be1c43fa57fac5b7a590191.webm?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability! Everything is randomly generated so no two runs are the same. In some runs you will get lucky and it will be easy and in others will be brutally hard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/99bacd0e46c5b443b5e5a8f91512c7dc.webp?t=1755557234\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget get to wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/d9821d0e9da544de49c120820822ea8b.poster.avif?t=1755557234\" width=674 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/d9821d0e9da544de49c120820822ea8b.webm?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/990c3e5fd2af864d949339594b9148f7.poster.avif?t=1755557234\" width=672 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/990c3e5fd2af864d949339594b9148f7.webm?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/990c3e5fd2af864d949339594b9148f7.mp4?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig Dig Burrito is about a burrito inside a burrito digging through all the delicious ingredients inside<strong>\ud83c\udf2f.\u00a0</strong>But you must be careful some ingredients can kill you! You will encounter many different enemies that try to kill you. You'll also choose between many different types of burritos that have drastically different gameplay. Also every burrito is unique and has many different types ingredients, some good some bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/49bc601735091ac72eb589ab63ff2ab3.webp?t=1755557234\" width=672 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/847ee7654f9b7d84717fbbc01a15996f.poster.avif?t=1755557234\" width=674 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508050/extras/847ee7654f9b7d84717fbbc01a15996f.webm?t=1755557234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ random burrito events that you can play through. Every 